### ===================================
### Example Star List API Tests
### Base Path: /api/word/example/star/list
### ===================================

### Get User's Example Star Lists
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/example/star/list
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get Example Star List by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/example/star/list/1

###

### Create Example Star List
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/word/example/star/list
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listName": "My Example Sentences",
  "remark": "Useful example sentences"
}

###

### Update Example Star List
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/word/example/star/list/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listName": "Updated Example List",
  "remark": "Updated remark"
}

###

### Add Example to List
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/word/example/star/list/1/example/1

###

### Remove Example from List
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/word/example/star/list/1/example/1

###

### Delete Example Star List
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/word/example/star/list/1
